---
title: "Scenariul 1: telemetrie peste prag → alarmă"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as TemperatureSensor
    participant P as PeriodicTelemetryTask<br/>(task periodic)
    participant Q as coada alarmEvents
    participant A as SporadicAlarmTask<br/>(task sporadic)
    participant B as Broker MQTT
    participant M as MessageProcessor<br/>(business-service)
    participant CSV as CsvStorage
    participant D as Dashboard

    Note over P: eliberare r_k = r_0 + k·T<br/>(așteptare absolută)
    P->>S: read()
    S-->>P: 29.42
    P-)B: publish telemetry<br/>"device-1#59;t#59;29.42"
    B-)M: telemetry (abonare cu +)
    M->>CSV: append("telemetry", mesaj)
    M->>D: updateTelemetry("device-1", 29.42)
    Note over P: 29.42 > prag 28.0
    P-)Q: put(AlarmEvent(29.42, 28.0, t_sosire))
    Note over P: jobul k se termină,<br/>așteaptă r_k+1
    Q-)A: take()
    alt au trecut ≥ 5000 ms de la ultima eliberare
        Note over A: eliberare acceptată
        A-)B: publish alarm<br/>"device-1#59;t#59;29.42#59;28.00"
        Note over A: verifică R ≤ D (500 ms)
        B-)M: alarm
        M->>CSV: append("alarm", mesaj)
        M->>D: updateAlarm("device-1", 29.42)
        Note over M: afișează imediat<br/>"!!! ALARMĂ device-1 ..."
    else au trecut < 5000 ms
        Note over A: eveniment RESPINS<br/>(nu se publică nimic)
    end
